@startuml
title Gym web: forgot password and reset

actor User
participant "ForgotPasswordScreen" as Forgot
participant "AuthApiClient" as Auth
participant "services/auth" as AuthServer
participant "Email" as Mail
participant "ResetPasswordScreen" as Reset

User -> Forgot: submit(email)
Forgot -> Auth: forgotPassword(email)
Auth -> AuthServer: POST /auth/forgot-password
AuthServer --> Auth: 200 { status: "pending_reset" }
Auth --> Forgot: ok
Forgot --> User: generic success message

AuthServer -> Mail: send reset link
Mail -> User: email with /reset-password?token=...
User -> Reset: open link, submit new password
Reset -> Auth: resetPassword(token, newPassword)
Auth -> AuthServer: POST /auth/reset-password
AuthServer --> Auth: 200 { status: "password_reset" }
Auth --> Reset: ok
Reset --> User: navigate("/login")

@enduml
